#: kab_htmlexport.cc:540
msgid ""
"<qt><b>Sorry!</b>"
"<br>"
"<br>Exporting to HTML failed. Problems might be caused by insufficient "
"permissions in the target directory or failures in the setup of your KDE 2 "
"installation."
"<br>"
"<br>If you created your own template folder, mistakes in there may also "
"cause errors. As a last possibility, the KDE address book may be buggy, too "
":-(.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>Žao mi je!</b>"
"<br>"
"<br>Izvoz u HTML je neuspešan. Problem može biti prouzrokovan sa "
"nedostatkom dozvola u odredišnom direktorijuma ili usled pogrešnog "
"podešavanja vaše KDE 2 instalacije."
"<br>"
"<br>Ako ste kreirali vaš direktorijum šablona, greške se mogu i tu "
"javiti. Kao zadnja opcija, KDE adresar može sadržati grešle :-(.</qt>"

